### 2. Query Report PROFILE_SUMMARY_BY_PERSONA
GET {{hosturl}}/query-report/PROFILE_SUMMARY_BY_PERSONA
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
x-tenant-id: {{xTenantId}}
